# Tomik's ability caps the declaration of attackers alone (the card's ruling): an effect can still put another creature
# onto the battlefield attacking a planeswalker you control that one creature is already attacking. Bot2 has Tomik and
# Wrenn and Six. Bot1 declares Adeline, Resplendent Cathar alone at Wrenn - one attacker, legal - and Adeline's "whenever
# you attack" makes a Human token (CR 508.4) that Bot1 chooses to put into play attacking Wrenn too. Wrenn, at 3 loyalty,
# takes Adeline's 2 plus the Human's 1 and dies.

